  "duration_s": 466.206897,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "一九三七年，杭州钱塘江边，一个戴眼镜的中年人，站在自己花了三年。这九百二十五个日夜建成的大桥桥头，他身后是几十万哭喊着的逃难百姓，他面前是扬着尘土马上就要到的日本骑兵。然后他做了一个决定，把自己这辈子的心头骨肉炸掉了。这座桥通车才八十九天。今天这个故事最狠的不是炸桥，是炸桥之前他干的事先说这个人是谁？先说茅以生中国现代桥梁之父。上世纪三十年代，全世界的工程师都断言，钱塘江上不可能建桥江底，四十米厚的流沙一脚踩下去，直往下陷，水深的看不见底。潮水一来，能把几百吨的沉香先着走。杭州人有句歇后语，钱塘江上造桥不可能毛以生，不信邪。他带着团队蹲在江滩上，硬是发明了涉水法打桩臣襄法驻敦福运法架梁，解决了八十多个技术难题。有一次，一个六百吨重的沉乡被大潮冲走，毛以生带着人在江面上追了三天三夜才拖回来。一九三七年九月二十六日，第一列火车从桥上开过。汽笛一响，两岸老百姓哭着喊中国人自己造的。全长一千四百五十三米，上层跑汽车下层跑火车。中国第一座双层铁路公路两用桥全部由中国人自己设计，自己建造。可就在全杭州都在欢呼的时候，没人知道这两件事。第一件卢沟桥的枪声一响，茅倚声就偷偷改了自己设计的图纸。在南岸那个桥墩的肚子里，他留下一个长方形的空洞，别人问他干什么用的，他一个字都不解释，那是预留的爆破材料室。第二件总工程师罗英建桥的时候出过一个上联，钱塘江桥五行缺火。你看前四个字金字旁土字旁、三点水、木字旁偏偏缺个火，他一直等人来对下联结，过火真来了。一九三七年十一月十六日，南京的紧急命令送到毛以生手上，杭州不保，即刻扎桥。当晚，毛以生一夜没睡，他拿着笔把这座桥所有的致命点，一个一个标在图纸上，就像给自己的亲儿子挑断筋骨的位置。工程兵问他确定要炸这么狠。他说，诈不狠，敌人就能拿来用爆破材料往桥里一装，乔墩肚子里二十二香，每箱四百四十公斤，蹲着两头，再挂十六香，旁边那个墩子再来十四降，加起来一万多公斤，一百几十根引线全部拧到南岸一间房子里边引爆气上。他后来在回忆录里写了一句话，我第一次读到的时候，后背是麻的。开桥的第一天桥里就先有了放爆破材料的地，这在古今中外的桥梁史上要算是空前的了。可是接下来所有人都想不到的事发生了，引线都接好了，随时能炸毛以生，却开始往省政府跑，一遍一遍的磨，再等等，再让我等等。他要多等三十七天，为什么？因为桥还能过人，十一月十七日，公路桥开放就那一天，十万多难民从桥上走过去，逃难整个八十九天里，三百多台机车两千多节车厢从桥上抢运。过江转移的军民上百万人运走的物资价值比这座桥五百四十万银元的造价还要贵。闸桥命令早一天执行，日军早一天过江，晚一天就多救一天的人。毛益生这是在拿桥换命。他知道这座桥每一根钢梁值多少钱，他更知道桥上每一个难民值多少钱。一九三七年十二月二十三日下午，日军骑兵的烟尘在桥头已经看得见了。紧急命令再次传来，立即炸。可北岸还有成千上万的人在哭喊着要过江茅蚁升墙，压着引爆器一分一秒的熬。直到下午五点，人群清完通道关闭，日本兵的马已经到了视野里。他说，引爆一声巨响，五孔每孔六十七米的钢梁砸进钱塘江南岸那座他亲手建的桥墩炸的只剩半截斜着歪在水面上。事后核对爆炸结果和计划分毫不差。敌人就算想修，短期也修不好。大桥总工程处解散的当晚，毛以生写下了十个字，抗战必胜，此乔必复他嫌不够，又写了一首诗，最后七个字是不负元桥不丈夫。然后他干了最后一件事，把剑桥的档案和图纸装了整整十四箱，一路护送到后方桥可以炸，图纸不能丢，那是富桥的种子。很多人问，毛以生毁掉自己一生的心血值吗？他自己早就回答了，剑桥是为了争气，炸桥是为了胜利桥炸了，可以再修，国家没了，就什么都没了。毛以生亲自炸掉，自己心血的故事就写在国之脊梁。这本书里，书里还有四十多位，像他这样的人，每一位讲出来都能让你红着眼眶看完。但这座桥的传奇才到一半，你以为炸完就结束了？接下来发生的事更狠下一集。毛以生系列第二集，这座桥，前前后后被炸了四次，谁都拆不掉，他谁也没法真正拥有他。如果你被这个故事打动了，点个赞，收藏起来，关注我，下一集更震撼。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 1250,
      "text": "一九三七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1730,
      "end_ms": 3410,
      "text": "杭州钱塘江边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4330,
      "end_ms": 6510,
      "text": "一个戴眼镜的中年人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7210,
      "end_ms": 9030,
      "text": "站在自己花了三年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9890,
      "end_ms": 14490,
      "text": "这九百二十五个日夜建成的大桥桥头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00006",
      "start_ms": 15570,
      "end_ms": 19590,
      "text": "他身后是几十万哭喊着的逃难百姓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00007",
      "start_ms": 20250,
      "end_ms": 25230,
      "text": "他面前是扬着尘土马上就要到的日本骑兵。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00008",
      "start_ms": 25690,
      "end_ms": 27810,
      "text": "然后他做了一个决定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00009",
      "start_ms": 28210,
      "end_ms": 31560,
      "text": "把自己这辈子的心头骨肉炸掉了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00010",
      "start_ms": 33040,
      "end_ms": 36820,
      "text": "这座桥通车才八十九天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00011",
      "start_ms": 38000,
      "end_ms": 42500,
      "text": "今天这个故事最狠的不是炸桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00012",
      "start_ms": 42740,
      "end_ms": 46940,
      "text": "是炸桥之前他干的事先说这个人是谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00013",
      "start_ms": 47860,
      "end_ms": 51240,
      "text": "先说茅以生中国现代桥梁之父。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00014",
      "start_ms": 52180,
      "end_ms": 53700,
      "text": "上世纪三十年代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00015",
      "start_ms": 54060,
      "end_ms": 56020,
      "text": "全世界的工程师都断言，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00016",
      "start_ms": 56780,
      "end_ms": 60010,
      "text": "钱塘江上不可能建桥江底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00017",
      "start_ms": 60150,
      "end_ms": 62670,
      "text": "四十米厚的流沙一脚踩下去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00018",
      "start_ms": 62670,
      "end_ms": 63465,
      "text": "直往下陷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00019",
      "start_ms": 63880,
      "end_ms": 65475,
      "text": "水深的看不见底。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00020",
      "start_ms": 65990,
      "end_ms": 66890,
      "text": "潮水一来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00021",
      "start_ms": 67190,
      "end_ms": 70105,
      "text": "能把几百吨的沉香先着走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00022",
      "start_ms": 70870,
      "end_ms": 72435,
      "text": "杭州人有句歇后语，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00023",
      "start_ms": 72950,
      "end_ms": 76580,
      "text": "钱塘江上造桥不可能毛以生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00024",
      "start_ms": 76580,
      "end_ms": 77345,
      "text": "不信邪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00025",
      "start_ms": 78000,
      "end_ms": 80480,
      "text": "他带着团队蹲在江滩上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00026",
      "start_ms": 80560,
      "end_ms": 85695,
      "text": "硬是发明了涉水法打桩臣襄法驻敦福运法架梁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00027",
      "start_ms": 86080,
      "end_ms": 88095,
      "text": "解决了八十多个技术难题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00028",
      "start_ms": 89020,
      "end_ms": 89615,
      "text": "有一次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00029",
      "start_ms": 90040,
      "end_ms": 93905,
      "text": "一个六百吨重的沉乡被大潮冲走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00030",
      "start_ms": 94430,
      "end_ms": 98975,
      "text": "毛以生带着人在江面上追了三天三夜才拖回来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00031",
      "start_ms": 100050,
      "end_ms": 101885,
      "text": "一九三七年九月二十六日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00032",
      "start_ms": 102660,
      "end_ms": 104625,
      "text": "第一列火车从桥上开过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00033",
      "start_ms": 105530,
      "end_ms": 106415,
      "text": "汽笛一响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00034",
      "start_ms": 106860,
      "end_ms": 110255,
      "text": "两岸老百姓哭着喊中国人自己造的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00035",
      "start_ms": 110550,
      "end_ms": 112785,
      "text": "全长一千四百五十三米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00036",
      "start_ms": 113710,
      "end_ms": 116260,
      "text": "上层跑汽车下层跑火车。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00037",
      "start_ms": 116380,
      "end_ms": 122340,
      "text": "中国第一座双层铁路公路两用桥全部由中国人自己设计，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00038",
      "start_ms": 122620,
      "end_ms": 123640,
      "text": "自己建造。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00039",
      "start_ms": 124220,
      "end_ms": 126920,
      "text": "可就在全杭州都在欢呼的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00040",
      "start_ms": 127200,
      "end_ms": 128820,
      "text": "没人知道这两件事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00041",
      "start_ms": 129240,
      "end_ms": 133850,
      "text": "第一件卢沟桥的枪声一响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00042",
      "start_ms": 134370,
      "end_ms": 138290,
      "text": "茅倚声就偷偷改了自己设计的图纸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00043",
      "start_ms": 138810,
      "end_ms": 141030,
      "text": "在南岸那个桥墩的肚子里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00044",
      "start_ms": 141130,
      "end_ms": 143430,
      "text": "他留下一个长方形的空洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00045",
      "start_ms": 144090,
      "end_ms": 145930,
      "text": "别人问他干什么用的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00046",
      "start_ms": 146090,
      "end_ms": 147610,
      "text": "他一个字都不解释，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00047",
      "start_ms": 147969,
      "end_ms": 150490,
      "text": "那是预留的爆破材料室。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00048",
      "start_ms": 151210,
      "end_ms": 158210,
      "text": "第二件总工程师罗英建桥的时候出过一个上联，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00049",
      "start_ms": 158650,
      "end_ms": 161090,
      "text": "钱塘江桥五行缺火。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00050",
      "start_ms": 161490,
      "end_ms": 166780,
      "text": "你看前四个字金字旁土字旁、三点水、木字旁偏偏缺个火，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00051",
      "start_ms": 167280,
      "end_ms": 169820,
      "text": "他一直等人来对下联结，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00052",
      "start_ms": 169820,
      "end_ms": 172580,
      "text": "过火真来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00053",
      "start_ms": 173620,
      "end_ms": 176220,
      "text": "一九三七年十一月十六日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00054",
      "start_ms": 176940,
      "end_ms": 180835,
      "text": "南京的紧急命令送到毛以生手上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00055",
      "start_ms": 181670,
      "end_ms": 182805,
      "text": "杭州不保，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00056",
      "start_ms": 184210,
      "end_ms": 185215,
      "text": "即刻扎桥。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00057",
      "start_ms": 186360,
      "end_ms": 186875,
      "text": "当晚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00058",
      "start_ms": 187210,
      "end_ms": 189105,
      "text": "毛以生一夜没睡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00059",
      "start_ms": 189580,
      "end_ms": 192845,
      "text": "他拿着笔把这座桥所有的致命点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00060",
      "start_ms": 193240,
      "end_ms": 195295,
      "text": "一个一个标在图纸上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00061",
      "start_ms": 195930,
      "end_ms": 199630,
      "text": "就像给自己的亲儿子挑断筋骨的位置。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00062",
      "start_ms": 199790,
      "end_ms": 202395,
      "text": "工程兵问他确定要炸这么狠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00063",
      "start_ms": 202940,
      "end_ms": 203380,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00064",
      "start_ms": 203680,
      "end_ms": 204285,
      "text": "诈不狠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00065",
      "start_ms": 204590,
      "end_ms": 208175,
      "text": "敌人就能拿来用爆破材料往桥里一装，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00066",
      "start_ms": 208610,
      "end_ms": 210535,
      "text": "乔墩肚子里二十二香，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00067",
      "start_ms": 211030,
      "end_ms": 212885,
      "text": "每箱四百四十公斤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00068",
      "start_ms": 213530,
      "end_ms": 214330,
      "text": "蹲着两头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00069",
      "start_ms": 214330,
      "end_ms": 215295,
      "text": "再挂十六香，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00070",
      "start_ms": 215690,
      "end_ms": 217625,
      "text": "旁边那个墩子再来十四降，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00071",
      "start_ms": 218080,
      "end_ms": 219565,
      "text": "加起来一万多公斤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00072",
      "start_ms": 219990,
      "end_ms": 225795,
      "text": "一百几十根引线全部拧到南岸一间房子里边引爆气上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00073",
      "start_ms": 226290,
      "end_ms": 228225,
      "text": "他后来在回忆录里写了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00074",
      "start_ms": 229830,
      "end_ms": 231390,
      "text": "我第一次读到的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00075",
      "start_ms": 231490,
      "end_ms": 232655,
      "text": "后背是麻的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00076",
      "start_ms": 233310,
      "end_ms": 238115,
      "text": "开桥的第一天桥里就先有了放爆破材料的地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00077",
      "start_ms": 239230,
      "end_ms": 243805,
      "text": "这在古今中外的桥梁史上要算是空前的了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00078",
      "start_ms": 244200,
      "end_ms": 248005,
      "text": "可是接下来所有人都想不到的事发生了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00079",
      "start_ms": 248430,
      "end_ms": 249695,
      "text": "引线都接好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00080",
      "start_ms": 250040,
      "end_ms": 252190,
      "text": "随时能炸毛以生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00081",
      "start_ms": 252190,
      "end_ms": 253865,
      "text": "却开始往省政府跑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00082",
      "start_ms": 254260,
      "end_ms": 255625,
      "text": "一遍一遍的磨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00083",
      "start_ms": 256030,
      "end_ms": 256675,
      "text": "再等等，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00084",
      "start_ms": 256990,
      "end_ms": 257825,
      "text": "再让我等等。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00085",
      "start_ms": 258450,
      "end_ms": 260155,
      "text": "他要多等三十七天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00086",
      "start_ms": 261800,
      "end_ms": 262295,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00087",
      "start_ms": 263780,
      "end_ms": 265245,
      "text": "因为桥还能过人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00088",
      "start_ms": 267480,
      "end_ms": 268965,
      "text": "十一月十七日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00089",
      "start_ms": 270080,
      "end_ms": 272945,
      "text": "公路桥开放就那一天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00090",
      "start_ms": 273720,
      "end_ms": 276620,
      "text": "十万多难民从桥上走过去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00091",
      "start_ms": 276700,
      "end_ms": 279885,
      "text": "逃难整个八十九天里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00092",
      "start_ms": 280470,
      "end_ms": 286100,
      "text": "三百多台机车两千多节车厢从桥上抢运。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00093",
      "start_ms": 286120,
      "end_ms": 296345,
      "text": "过江转移的军民上百万人运走的物资价值比这座桥五百四十万银元的造价还要贵。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00094",
      "start_ms": 297000,
      "end_ms": 299165,
      "text": "闸桥命令早一天执行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00095",
      "start_ms": 299670,
      "end_ms": 301365,
      "text": "日军早一天过江，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00096",
      "start_ms": 301890,
      "end_ms": 304245,
      "text": "晚一天就多救一天的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00097",
      "start_ms": 305090,
      "end_ms": 306905,
      "text": "毛益生这是在拿桥换命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00098",
      "start_ms": 307330,
      "end_ms": 310610,
      "text": "他知道这座桥每一根钢梁值多少钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00099",
      "start_ms": 310690,
      "end_ms": 314150,
      "text": "他更知道桥上每一个难民值多少钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00100",
      "start_ms": 314970,
      "end_ms": 318150,
      "text": "一九三七年十二月二十三日下午，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00101",
      "start_ms": 318570,
      "end_ms": 322690,
      "text": "日军骑兵的烟尘在桥头已经看得见了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00102",
      "start_ms": 323030,
      "end_ms": 325270,
      "text": "紧急命令再次传来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00103",
      "start_ms": 325790,
      "end_ms": 326470,
      "text": "立即炸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00104",
      "start_ms": 327670,
      "end_ms": 332870,
      "text": "可北岸还有成千上万的人在哭喊着要过江茅蚁升墙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00105",
      "start_ms": 332990,
      "end_ms": 335870,
      "text": "压着引爆器一分一秒的熬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00106",
      "start_ms": 336290,
      "end_ms": 337680,
      "text": "直到下午五点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00107",
      "start_ms": 337720,
      "end_ms": 339760,
      "text": "人群清完通道关闭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00108",
      "start_ms": 340300,
      "end_ms": 344400,
      "text": "日本兵的马已经到了视野里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00109",
      "start_ms": 345299,
      "end_ms": 345865,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00110",
      "start_ms": 347790,
      "end_ms": 351360,
      "text": "引爆一声巨响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00111",
      "start_ms": 351600,
      "end_ms": 362660,
      "text": "五孔每孔六十七米的钢梁砸进钱塘江南岸那座他亲手建的桥墩炸的只剩半截斜着歪在水面上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00112",
      "start_ms": 363040,
      "end_ms": 366240,
      "text": "事后核对爆炸结果和计划分毫不差。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00113",
      "start_ms": 366720,
      "end_ms": 368155,
      "text": "敌人就算想修，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00114",
      "start_ms": 368680,
      "end_ms": 370145,
      "text": "短期也修不好。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00115",
      "start_ms": 370930,
      "end_ms": 373775,
      "text": "大桥总工程处解散的当晚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00116",
      "start_ms": 374430,
      "end_ms": 376925,
      "text": "毛以生写下了十个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00117",
      "start_ms": 377720,
      "end_ms": 378915,
      "text": "抗战必胜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00118",
      "start_ms": 379400,
      "end_ms": 382455,
      "text": "此乔必复他嫌不够，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00119",
      "start_ms": 384130,
      "end_ms": 385210,
      "text": "又写了一首诗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00120",
      "start_ms": 385490,
      "end_ms": 389455,
      "text": "最后七个字是不负元桥不丈夫。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00121",
      "start_ms": 390060,
      "end_ms": 392195,
      "text": "然后他干了最后一件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00122",
      "start_ms": 392680,
      "end_ms": 396444,
      "text": "把剑桥的档案和图纸装了整整十四箱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00123",
      "start_ms": 396920,
      "end_ms": 399595,
      "text": "一路护送到后方桥可以炸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00124",
      "start_ms": 400040,
      "end_ms": 400885,
      "text": "图纸不能丢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00125",
      "start_ms": 401290,
      "end_ms": 402565,
      "text": "那是富桥的种子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00126",
      "start_ms": 403300,
      "end_ms": 404195,
      "text": "很多人问，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00127",
      "start_ms": 404610,
      "end_ms": 407985,
      "text": "毛以生毁掉自己一生的心血值吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00128",
      "start_ms": 408550,
      "end_ms": 409985,
      "text": "他自己早就回答了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00129",
      "start_ms": 410960,
      "end_ms": 412745,
      "text": "剑桥是为了争气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00130",
      "start_ms": 413120,
      "end_ms": 415820,
      "text": "炸桥是为了胜利桥炸了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00131",
      "start_ms": 415820,
      "end_ms": 416595,
      "text": "可以再修，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00132",
      "start_ms": 416990,
      "end_ms": 417710,
      "text": "国家没了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00133",
      "start_ms": 417710,
      "end_ms": 418715,
      "text": "就什么都没了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00134",
      "start_ms": 419690,
      "end_ms": 421730,
      "text": "毛以生亲自炸掉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00135",
      "start_ms": 421730,
      "end_ms": 426180,
      "text": "自己心血的故事就写在国之脊梁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00136",
      "start_ms": 426240,
      "end_ms": 427005,
      "text": "这本书里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00137",
      "start_ms": 427650,
      "end_ms": 429050,
      "text": "书里还有四十多位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00138",
      "start_ms": 429050,
      "end_ms": 430030,
      "text": "像他这样的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00139",
      "start_ms": 430050,
      "end_ms": 433585,
      "text": "每一位讲出来都能让你红着眼眶看完。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00140",
      "start_ms": 434230,
      "end_ms": 437225,
      "text": "但这座桥的传奇才到一半，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00141",
      "start_ms": 437710,
      "end_ms": 439985,
      "text": "你以为炸完就结束了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00142",
      "start_ms": 440960,
      "end_ms": 446165,
      "text": "接下来发生的事更狠下一集。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00143",
      "start_ms": 446520,
      "end_ms": 448785,
      "text": "毛以生系列第二集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00144",
      "start_ms": 449570,
      "end_ms": 450395,
      "text": "这座桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00145",
      "start_ms": 450830,
      "end_ms": 453335,
      "text": "前前后后被炸了四次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00146",
      "start_ms": 453870,
      "end_ms": 454930,
      "text": "谁都拆不掉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00147",
      "start_ms": 454930,
      "end_ms": 458015,
      "text": "他谁也没法真正拥有他。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00148",
      "start_ms": 458760,
      "end_ms": 460455,
      "text": "如果你被这个故事打动了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00149",
      "start_ms": 460670,
      "end_ms": 461275,
      "text": "点个赞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00150",
      "start_ms": 461740,
      "end_ms": 462625,
      "text": "收藏起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00151",
      "start_ms": 463570,
      "end_ms": 464185,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_378fc52ecb005cce_s00152",
      "start_ms": 464470,
      "end_ms": 466035,
      "text": "下一集更震撼。"
    }
  ],
